"}},"known":["ac9fc812af2d7f9f654f7bcc90ef5da8"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-correa-lugares","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"derechos","category":"administracion","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"multi","prompt":"Paseas un perro de compañía corriente por St. Gallen. ¿En cuáles de estos lugares exige correa la ley cantonal?","options":["En el tren y la estación","En instalaciones escolares","En parques infantiles públicos","En absolutamente todo terreno privado cerrado"],"explanation":"La ley también menciona edificios de acceso público. Los municipios pueden añadir lugares señalizados.","sources":[{"id":"sg-dogs-17","url":"https://www.gesetzessammlung.sg.ch/frontend/versions/2873/download_pdf_file?locale=de","title":"St. Gallen · Ley de perros","authority":"Gesetzessammlung Kanton St.Gallen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"sGS456.1, arts.6–14"}],"source_url":"https://www.gesetzessammlung.sg.ch/frontend/versions/2873/download_pdf_file?locale=de","source_title":"St. Gallen · Ley de perros","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SG:correa-lugares","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","game_only":true,"correct_indices":[0,1,2],"correct_index":0},"known":["891a97614e4e29f799aa20b9044204b4"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-perro-seguro","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"derechos","category":"administracion","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Tienes un perro en St. Gallen y otra persona lo saca a pasear. ¿Qué cobertura exige la ley?","options":["Solo la responsabilidad del propietario de la vivienda","Responsabilidad civil que incluya al titular y a quien realmente lo vigila","Solo los daños del perro dentro de casa","Solo un seguro de accidentes de la persona titular"],"explanation":"Es una obligación distinta del registro y del impuesto canino.","sources":[{"id":"sg-dogs-17","url":"https://www.gesetzessammlung.sg.ch/frontend/versions/2873/download_pdf_file?locale=de","title":"St. Gallen · Ley de perros","authority":"Gesetzessammlung Kanton St.Gallen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"sGS456.1, arts.6–14"}],"source_url":"https://www.gesetzessammlung.sg.ch/frontend/versions/2873/download_pdf_file?locale=de","source_title":"St. Gallen · Ley de perros","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SG:perro-seguro","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":1,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["bbdf94827a441669cfb99da050874914"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-viernes-ruido","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Viernes a las 22:30, música fuerte en una vivienda de la ciudad de St. Gallen. ¿Qué indica la policía municipal sobre esa hora?","options":["Que el viernes se permite ruido hasta medianoche","Que el descanso empieza a las 23:00","Que ya está dentro de la franja nocturna de 22:00 a 07:00","Que el horario lo decide cada vecino"],"explanation":"Puedes pedir consideración y, si persiste la perturbación, contactar con la policía municipal. No se está calificando cualquier sonido normal como infracción.","sources":[{"id":"sg-noise-17","url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/gesellschaft-sicherheit/sicherheit-polizei/praevention/laerm-schallmessungen.html","title":"Ciudad de St. Gallen · Ruido y descanso","authority":"Stadtpolizei St.Gallen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Ruhezeiten/Nachtzeiten"}],"source_url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/gesellschaft-sicherheit/sicherheit-polizei/praevention/laerm-schallmessungen.html","source_title":"Ciudad de St. Gallen · Ruido y descanso","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SG:viernes-ruido","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":2,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["ecae8b347440b1653c57a2d0f19e232f"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-vidrio-domingo","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Domingo por la tarde, tienes botellas para el punto de recogida de la ciudad de St. Gallen. ¿Qué corresponde?","options":["Tirarlas rápido para que apenas se oiga","Dejarlas fuera del contenedor","Usarlo si no ves a nadie","Esperar un horario permitido: los puntos no se usan domingos ni festivos"],"explanation":"El horario también protege el descanso de las personas que viven cerca.","sources":[{"id":"sg-waste-17","url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/raum-umwelt/abfall-entsorgung/Abfallarten.html","title":"Ciudad de St. Gallen · Separación de residuos","authority":"Entsorgung St.Gallen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Abwasser, Aludosen, Einwurfszeiten, Altglas, Kehricht"}],"source_url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/raum-umwelt/abfall-entsorgung/Abfallarten.html","source_title":"Ciudad de St. Gallen · Separación de residuos","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SG:vidrio-domingo","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":3},"known":["fc24edfb0b9247e99cd600603d146abd"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-residuos-vasos","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"multi","prompt":"¿Qué objetos NO van con las botellas al contenedor de vidrio de la ciudad de St. Gallen?","options":["Vasos de beber","Cristales de ventana","Botellas de vidrio vacías aptas para esa recogida","Frascos de conserva de vidrio aptos para esa recogida"],"explanation":"Los diferentes tipos de vidrio no se reciclan todos por la misma vía. Consulta la vía local para vasos y cristales.","sources":[{"id":"sg-waste-17","url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/raum-umwelt/abfall-entsorgung/Abfallarten.html","title":"Ciudad de St. Gallen · Separación de residuos","authority":"Entsorgung St.Gallen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Abwasser, Aludosen, Einwurfszeiten, Altglas, Kehricht"}],"source_url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/raum-umwelt/abfall-entsorgung/Abfallarten.html","source_title":"Ciudad de St. Gallen · Separación de residuos","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SG:residuos-vasos","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","game_only":true,"correct_indices":[0,1],"correct_index":0},"known":["b2a1bae1c9f0e4fb921dd49acd3db078"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-wc-residuos","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Después de limpiar el baño en St. Gallen, ¿dónde deben ir los bastoncillos y las compresas usados?","options":["Al inodoro","A los residuos domésticos, según las indicaciones locales","Al contenedor de botellas","A una alcantarilla de la calle"],"explanation":"La red de saneamiento no es una papelera. La ciudad los incluye entre lo que no debe tirarse al váter.","sources":[{"id":"sg-waste-17","url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/raum-umwelt/abfall-entsorgung/Abfallarten.html","title":"Ciudad de St. Gallen · Separación de residuos","authority":"Entsorgung St.Gallen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Abwasser, Aludosen, Einwurfszeiten, Altglas, Kehricht"}],"source_url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/raum-umwelt/abfall-entsorgung/Abfallarten.html","source_title":"Ciudad de St. Gallen · Separación de residuos","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SG:wc-residuos","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":1},"known":["10ebdd18af1a947c9c7cd1e3fdee6091"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-prima-oficina","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"tramites","category":"salud","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"¿Qué entidad gestiona la reducción de primas en el cantón de St. Gallen?","options":["La oficina de turismo","El vendedor de un seguro de viaje","La Sozialversicherungsanstalt, SVA St.Gallen","La biblioteca de la abadía"],"explanation":"La oficina AHV de tu municipio también orienta si no puedes completar la solicitud por internet.","sources":[{"id":"sg-ipv-17","url":"https://www.sg.ch/gesundheit-soziales/gesundheit/krankenversicherung0/praemienverbilligung.html","title":"St. Gallen · Reducción de primas","authority":"Amt für Gesundheitsversorgung, Kanton St.Gallen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Antragsfrist; EL; Sozialhilfe"}],"source_url":"https://www.sg.ch/gesundheit-soziales/gesundheit/krankenversicherung0/praemienverbilligung.html","source_title":"St. Gallen · Reducción de primas","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SG:prima-oficina","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":2},"known":["7edd35c590bb076d51878f4efa163e56"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-