üe subterráneo.","sources":[{"id":"ai-lake-17","url":"https://www.appenzell.ch/de/alpstein/perlen-des-alpsteins/saemtisersee.html","title":"Alpstein · Sämtisersee","authority":"Appenzellerland Tourismus AI","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Descripción del agua y variaciones"}],"source_url":"https://www.appenzell.ch/de/alpstein/perlen-des-alpsteins/saemtisersee.html","source_title":"Alpstein · Sämtisersee","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"AI:saemtiser-desague","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["10849079e6416fee604f403712c69734"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ai-saemtiser-verano","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"AI","scope":"canton","canton":"AI","topic":"naturaleza","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Tras un verano muy caluroso, el Sämtisersee aparece mucho más pequeño. ¿Qué indica su descripción?","options":["Su nivel es constante durante todo el año","Que su nivel fluctúa mucho y puede casi secarse parcialmente","Se vacía a diario para generar electricidad","Es un lago que nunca pierde agua"],"explanation":"El nivel de un lago de montaña no tiene por qué mantenerse constante.","sources":[{"id":"ai-lake-17","url":"https://www.appenzell.ch/de/alpstein/perlen-des-alpsteins/saemtisersee.html","title":"Alpstein · Sämtisersee","authority":"Appenzellerland Tourismus AI","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Descripción del agua y variaciones"}],"source_url":"https://www.appenzell.ch/de/alpstein/perlen-des-alpsteins/saemtisersee.html","source_title":"Alpstein · Sämtisersee","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"AI:sae