 campo de lava reciente","Una ribera de grava junto a un río"],"explanation":"Esa base rocosa contribuye a su aspecto particular.","sources":[{"id":"sz-forest-17","url":"https://stoos-muotatal.ch/activities/boedmeren-urwald/","title":"Muotatal · Bosque de Bödmeren","authority":"Stoos-Muotatal Tourismus","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Urwaldreservat, Urwaldpavillon, Urwaldspur"}],"source_url":"https://stoos-muotatal.ch/activities/boedmeren-urwald/","source_title":"Muotatal · Bosque de Bödmeren","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"SZ:boedmeren-suelo","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["9bc99d283f20a3750fea6ef046bcc6d8"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sz-komin-orientacion","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SZ","scope":"canton","canton":"SZ","topic":"tramites","category":"administracion","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Buscas un curso de alemán y orientación para integrarte en Schwyz. ¿Qué servicio cita el cantón?","options":["La aduana de un aeropuerto extranjero","komin","Una empresa de remolques","La oficina meteorológica de otro país"],"explanation":"El servicio también orienta sobre conflictos interculturales y cuestiones sociales específicas.","sources":[{"id":"sz-integration-17","url":"https://www.sz.ch/verwaltung/volkswirtschaftsdepartement/amt-fuer-migration/integration/integrationsmassnahmen.html/8756-8758-8802-10373-10961-11005-11011","title":"Schwyz · Orientación e integración","authority":"Amt für Migration Kanton Schwyz","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Information und Beratung, Diskriminierung, Deutschkurse, Verständigung"}],"source_url":"https://www.sz.ch/verwaltung/volkswirtschaftsdepartement/amt-fuer-migration/integration/integrationsmassnahmen.html/8756-8758-8802-10373-10961-11005-11011","source_title":"Schwyz · Orientación e integración","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SZ:komin-orientacion","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":1},"known":["9eee7f3da2c95daa201ceb9bdafc6a14"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sz-komin-discriminacion","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SZ","scope":"canton","canton":"SZ","topic":"derechos","category":"administracion","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"En Schwyz sientes que te han tratado de forma discriminatoria por tu nacionalidad, color de piel o religión. ¿Qué recurso señala el cantón?","options":["Ignorar siempre lo ocurrido","Pagar una tasa a un vecino","La asesoría de protección ante discriminación de komin","Solicitar una visita guiada a una cueva"],"explanation":"También pueden pedir orientación quienes observan esas situaciones. La asesoría no prejuzga el resultado de un caso.","sources":[{"id":"sz-integration-17","url":"https://www.sz.ch/verwaltung/volkswirtschaftsdepartement/amt-fuer-migration/integration/integrationsmassnahmen.html/8756-8758-8802-10373-10961-11005-11011","title":"Schwyz · Orientación e integración","authority":"Amt für Migration Kanton Schwyz","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Information und Beratung, Diskriminierung, Deutschkurse, Verständigung"}],"source_url":"https://www.sz.ch/verwaltung/volkswirtschaftsdepartement/amt-fuer-migration/integration/integrationsmassnahmen.html/8756-8758-8802-10373-10961-11005-11011","source_title":"Schwyz · Orientación e integración","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SZ:komin-discriminacion","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":2},"known":["aa7537a844b