 manzana","Un reloj","Una moneda","Un sombrero"],"explanation":"Es un episodio del relato tradicional, no un hecho demostrado por la existencia del monumento.","sources":[{"id":"ur-tell-17","url":"https://uri.swiss/uri-1291/mythos-tell","title":"Uri · El mito de Tell","authority":"Uri Tourismus","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Dem Mythos Tell näher kommen"}],"source_url":"https://uri.swiss/uri-1291/mythos-tell","source_title":"Uri · El mito de Tell","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"UR:tell-manzana","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["c4db1846d134c87bcd15577d69152f28"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ur-puente-primer-cruce","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"UR","scope":"canton","canton":"UR","topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"En la leyenda de la Teufelsbrücke, ¿quién cruza primero para burlar al diablo?","options":["Un gato","Un macho cabrío","Un cisne","Un oso"],"explanation":"El trato pedía el primer ser que cruzara. La astucia del relato explica el nombre del puente.","sources":[{"id":"ur-facts-17","url":"https://www.ur.ch/_docn/410917/Zahlen_und_Fakten_Uri.pdf","title":"Uri · Patrimonio, dialecto y pasos alpinos","authority":"Uri Tourismus, folleto alojado por el cantón","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Páginas impresas 3–5, 11–12, 14–19 y 22–23"}],"source_url":"https://www.ur.ch/_docn/410917/Zahlen_und_Fakten_Uri.pdf","source_title":"Uri · Patrimonio, dialecto y pasos alpinos","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"UR:puente-primer-cruce","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil